127
00:05:02,402 --> 00:05:03,900
Secret number one.

128
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:06,936
The Revuelto's gearbox is sideways.

129
00:05:07,116 --> 00:05:08,342
In the Aventador,

130
00:05:08,342 --> 00:05:10,577
