132
00:05:13,136 --> 00:05:14,286
In the Revuelto,

133
00:05:14,286 --> 00:05:17,950
the new eight-speed dual-clutch gearbox sits behind

134
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:20,321
the engine, mounted transversely,

135
00:05:20,321 --> 00:05:21,399
across the car,

136
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:24,129
