137
00:05:24,129 --> 00:05:24,560
drive.

138
00:05:24,910 --> 00:05:26,315
Why would anyone do that?

139
00:05:26,495 --> 00:05:28,449
According to the reporting,

140
00:05:28,449 --> 00:05:32,138
Lamborghini chose the transverse layout to optimize

141
