149
00:05:48,521 --> 00:05:50,296
And there is a second reason,

150
00:05:50,296 --> 00:05:51,459
which is the twist.

151
00:05:51,639 --> 00:05:54,015
Moving the gearbox out of the middle

152
00:05:54,015 --> 00:05:55,996
